Assignment 3: Stack-Based Postfix Calculator with BST

This program evaluates postfix arithmetic expressions using an array-based stack.
It also stores variables and values using a binary search tree.

How to compile:
javac ADTStack\*.java

How to run:
java ADTStack.Main

Main files:
- StackInterface.java: defines the stack operations.
- ArrayStack.java: implements the stack using an array.
- BinarySearchTree.java: stores variables and values.
- Node.java: represents one BST node.
- PostfixCalculator.java: evaluates postfix expressions.
- Main.java: runs the sample test cases.
- ArrayStackTest.java: tests the stack.
- BinarySearchTreeTest.java: tests the BST.

Edge cases tested:
- Empty expression
- Unknown variable
- Division by zero
- Malformed token
